# -------------------------------------------------------------
# Rently — Cloud SQLite Database (Turso / libSQL) Configuration
# -------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Get your free Turso Cloud SQLite database:
#    - Sign up at https://turso.tech
#    - Create database: `turso db create rently-db`
#    - Get URL: `turso db show rently-db --url`
#    - Get Token: `turso db tokens create rently-db`
#
# 2. Add these to your local `.env` and in Vercel Project Settings > Environment Variables:
TURSO_DATABASE_URL=libsql://rently-db-yourusername.turso.io
TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN=your_turso_jwt_auth_token_here

# Optional: Frontend API URL (leave blank or /api for automated same-origin routing)
VITE_API_BASE=/api
